      "help_en": "The region ID.\n\nYou can call the https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/454314.html operation to query the IDs of available regions",
      "help_zh": "地域ID。\n您可以调用https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/454314.html接口查看地域ID",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "region_id",
